        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Roguelike&quot; redefined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rogue combines classic turn based RPG goodness with action based combat, creating a hybrid RPG experience. Quickly cut through your foes, or slow down and tackle groups of enemies with spells and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mystery items and gear, identify with scrolls of identification in classic style, then build, buff, and bolster your character for success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character classes are defined dynamically by play style, inventory use and composition, and equipped gear, giving players a different experience every run. The Rogue's class defines his stat growth, Body and Brain. Over 15 classes available include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue, Thief, Chef, Scholar, Paladin, Warlock, Legend, and the elusive Assassin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes include classic play with permadeath, casual mode for the less experienced players, and omega mode for a post game romp through billions of dungeons where 10 unique bosses hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards track and compare classic game completions and slayers of the omega bosses for a competitive touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required to play.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Roguelike&quot; redefined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rogue combines classic turn based RPG goodness with action based combat, creating a hybrid RPG experience. Quickly cut through your foes, or slow down and tackle groups of enemies with spells and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mystery items and gear, identify with scrolls of identification in classic style, then build, buff, and bolster your character for success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character classes are defined dynamically by play style, inventory use and composition, and equipped gear, giving players a different experience every run. The Rogue's class defines his stat growth, Body and Brain. Over 15 classes available include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue, Thief, Chef, Scholar, Paladin, Warlock, Legend, and the elusive Assassin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes include classic play with permadeath, casual mode for the less experienced players, and omega mode for a post game romp through billions of dungeons where 10 unique bosses hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online leaderboards track and compare classic game completions and slayers of the omega bosses for a competitive touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required to play.</p>",
